.TH "snakepit venv" 1  "snakepit venv " 
.SH NAME
snakepit venv \- 🏠 Virtual environment management
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsnakepit venv\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
🏠 Virtual environment management
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
snakepit venv\-create(1)
✨ Create a new virtual environment
.TP
snakepit venv\-activate(1)
⚡ Activate a virtual environment
.TP
snakepit venv\-delete(1)
🗑️  Delete a virtual environment
.TP
snakepit venv\-list(1)
📋 List all virtual environments
.TP
snakepit venv\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
